<deviceset name="1812CAN" prefix="L">
<description>&lt;b&gt;1812CAN Series Common Mode Chokes&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualification:	AEC-Q200&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package/Case:	1812 (4532 metric)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Temperature: -40ºC to 125ºC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tolerance:	30 %&lt;/li&gt;</description>
