<deviceset name="749020112B" prefix="T">
<description>&lt;b&gt;WE-LAN LAN Transformer

&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Characteristics 
&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Suitable for industrial temperatures from –40 °C up to +125 °C
&lt;BR&gt;Different version available from 1.5 kV isolation to 6 kV.
&lt;BR&gt;HPLE version
&lt;BR&gt;Additional CMC for higher attenuation
&lt;BR&gt;Non PoE, PoE and PoE++ up to 2 A
&lt;BR&gt;PoE up to 150 W and speeds up to 1 Gbit/s
&lt;BR&gt;Available in SMT
&lt;BR&gt;Compliant with standards: IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.3ab, IEEE 802.3af, IEEE 802.3at and IEEE 802.3bt
&lt;BR&gt;UL Recognized
&lt;BR&gt;</description>
